INSERT INTO `st_posts` VALUES (4633, 1, '2026-08-02 13:50:06', '2026-08-02 13:50:06', '<ul>\n							<li>\n										01. Featured Services \n									</li>\n						</ul>\n															<img src=\"http://sunstex.test/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/h2_img1.png\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />															\n					<h2>Find the perfect material with our service</h2>				\n		<p>From design, weaving and finishing to coating and fabrication, our specialists create technically advanced products that are integral to mission-critical applications all over the world.</p>		\n															<img src=\"http://sunstex.test/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/h2_img2.png\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />															\n        <h4><a href=\"http://sunstex.test/services/gia-cong-may-mac-oem/\">Gia Công May Mặc (OEM)</a></h4>\n        <img src=\"http://sunstex.test/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/fabric-1.svg\" alt=\"service icon\">    \n    <p>Sản xuất hàng may mặc theo yêu cầu với quy trình kiểm soát chất lượng nghiêm ngặt và năng lực đáp ứng đơn hàng lớn.</p>\n                    <img width=\"900\" height=\"522\" src=\"http://sunstex.test/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/service_1-910x528-1.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"http://sunstex.test/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/service_1-910x528-1.jpg 910w, http://sunstex.test/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/service_1-910x528-1-300x174.jpg 300w, http://sunstex.test/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/service_1-910x528-1-768x446.jpg 768w, http://sunstex.test/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/service_1-910x528-1-800x464.jpg 800w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 900px) 100vw, 900px\" />            <!-- .post-thumbnail -->\n        <h4><a href=\"http://sunstex.test/services/thiet-ke-phat-trien-mau-odm/\">Thiết Kế &#038; Phát Triển Mẫu (ODM)</a></h4>\n        <img src=\"http://sunstex.test/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/knitting.svg\" alt=\"service icon\">    \n    <p>Hỗ trợ thiết kế, phát triển mẫu và tư vấn chất liệu phù hợp với từng dòng sản phẩm và định hướng thương hiệu.</p>\n                    <img width=\"900\" height=\"522\" src=\"http://sunstex.test/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/service_2-910x528-1.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"http://sunstex.test/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/service_2-910x528-1.jpg 910w, http://sunstex.test/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/service_2-910x528-1-300x174.jpg 300w, http://sunstex.test/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/service_2-910x528-1-768x446.jpg 768w, http://sunstex.test/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/service_2-910x528-1-800x464.jpg 800w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 900px) 100vw, 900px\" />            <!-- .post-thumbnail -->\n        <h4><a href=\"http://sunstex.test/services/in-ky-thuat-so-tren-vai/\">In Kỹ Thuật Số Trên Vải</a></h4>\n        <img src=\"http://sunstex.test/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/coloring.svg\" alt=\"service icon\">    \n    <p>Ứng dụng công nghệ in hiện đại cho màu sắc sắc nét, bền màu và thân thiện với môi trường trên các chất liệu vải tự nhiên.</p>\n                    <img width=\"900\" height=\"522\" src=\"http://sunstex.test/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/service_3-910x528-1.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"http://sunstex.test/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/service_3-910x528-1.jpg 910w, http://sunstex.test/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/service_3-910x528-1-300x174.jpg 300w, http://sunstex.test/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/service_3-910x528-1-768x446.jpg 768w, http://sunstex.test/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/service_3-910x528-1-800x464.jpg 800w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 900px) 100vw, 900px\" />            <!-- .post-thumbnail -->\n        <h4><a href=\"http://sunstex.test/services/gia-cong-hoan-thien/\">Gia Công Hoàn Thiện</a></h4>\n        <img src=\"http://sunstex.test/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/leather.svg\" alt=\"service icon\">    \n    <p>Cắt, may, ép, thêu, đóng gói và hoàn thiện sản phẩm theo tiêu chuẩn xuất khẩu.</p>\n                    <img width=\"900\" height=\"522\" src=\"http://sunstex.test/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/service_4-910x528-1.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"http://sunstex.test/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/service_4-910x528-1.jpg 910w, http://sunstex.test/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/service_4-910x528-1-300x174.jpg 300w, http://sunstex.test/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/service_4-910x528-1-768x446.jpg 768w, http://sunstex.test/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/service_4-910x528-1-800x464.jpg 800w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 900px) 100vw, 900px\" />            <!-- .post-thumbnail -->\n        <h4><a href=\"http://sunstex.test/services/kiem-soat-chat-luong-qc/\">Kiểm Soát Chất Lượng (QC)</a></h4>\n        <img src=\"http://sunstex.test/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/sewing-machine.svg\" alt=\"service icon\">    \n    <p>Kiểm tra chất lượng ở từng công đoạn nhằm đảm bảo sản phẩm đạt yêu cầu trước khi giao đến khách hàng.</p>\n                    <img width=\"900\" height=\"522\" src=\"http://sunstex.test/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/service_5-910x528-1.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"http://sunstex.test/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/service_5-910x528-1.jpg 910w, http://sunstex.test/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/service_5-910x528-1-300x174.jpg 300w, http://sunstex.test/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/service_5-910x528-1-768x446.jpg 768w, http://sunstex.test/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/service_5-910x528-1-800x464.jpg 800w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 900px) 100vw, 900px\" />            <!-- .post-thumbnail -->\n        <h4><a href=\"http://sunstex.test/services/chuoi-cung-ung-giao-hang/\">Chuỗi Cung Ứng &#038; Giao Hàng</a></h4>\n        <img src=\"http://sunstex.test/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/network.svg\" alt=\"service icon\">    \n    <p>Technical solutions essential for modern textile factories striving to stay competitive.</p>\n                    <img width=\"900\" height=\"522\" src=\"http://sunstex.test/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/service_6.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"http://sunstex.test/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/service_6.jpg 1000w, http://sunstex.test/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/service_6-300x174.jpg 300w, http://sunstex.test/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/service_6-768x445.jpg 768w, http://sunstex.test/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/service_6-800x464.jpg 800w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 900px) 100vw, 900px\" />            <!-- .post-thumbnail -->\n                        <nav>\n                <ul class=\'page-numbers\'>\n	<li>Page1</li>\n	<li><a aria-label=\"Page 2\" href=\"http://sunstex.test/wp-admin/admin-ajax.php/page/2/\">Page2</a></li>\n	<li><a href=\"http://sunstex.test/wp-admin/admin-ajax.php/page/2/\"></a></li>\n</ul>\n        </nav>', 'Our Services', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '2391-autosave-v1', '', '', '2026-08-02 13:50:06', '2026-08-02 13:50:06', '', 2391, 'http://sunstex.test/?p=4633', 0, 'revision', '', 0);
INSERT INTO `st_posts` VALUES (4634, 1, '2026-08-02 14:42:26', '2026-08-02 14:42:26', '<h6>\n        <a href=\"http://sunstex.test/services/gia-cong-may-mac-oem/\">Gia Công May Mặc (OEM)</a>\n    </h6>\n    <h6>\n        <a href=\"http://sunstex.test/services/thiet-ke-phat-trien-mau-odm/\">Thiết Kế &#038; Phát Triển Mẫu (ODM)</a>\n    </h6>\n    <h6>\n        <a href=\"http://sunstex.test/services/in-ky-thuat-so-tren-vai/\">In Kỹ Thuật Số Trên Vải</a>\n    </h6>\n    <h6>\n        <a href=\"http://sunstex.test/services/gia-cong-hoan-thien/\">Gia Công Hoàn Thiện</a>\n    </h6>\n    <h6>\n        <a href=\"http://sunstex.test/services/kiem-soat-chat-luong-qc/\">Kiểm Soát Chất Lượng (QC)</a>\n    </h6>\n    <h6>\n        <a href=\"http://sunstex.test/services/chuoi-cung-ung-giao-hang/\">Chuỗi Cung Ứng &#038; Giao Hàng</a>\n    </h6>\n    <h6>\n        <a href=\"http://sunstex.test/services/oem-odm-san-xuat-theo-yeu-cau/\">OEM / ODM Sản Xuất Theo Yêu Cầu</a>\n    </h6>\n    <h6>\n        <a href=\"http://sunstex.test/services/dong-goi-xuat-khau/\">Đóng Gói &#038; Xuất Khẩu</a>\n    </h6>\n					<h6>Do You Need Help?</h6>				\n					<h4><a href=\"tel:+(084)%20456-0789\">+(084) 456-0789</a></h4>				\n					<h6><a href=\"mailto:support@example.com\">support@example.com</a></h6>				\n					<a href=\"http://sunstex.test/contact/\">\n									Nhận báo giá\n					</a>\n											<a href=\"http://sunstex.test\">\n						<h4>\n				Đóng Gói &#038; Xuất Khẩu  \n			</h4 > \n									</a>\n		<p>Woven textiles are fabrics created by interlacing two distinct sets of yarns—warp and weft—at right angles to each other. This traditional technique, used for thousands of years across cultures, forms the foundation of many types of cloth, from delicate silks to sturdy denims.<br />The warp threads run vertically on a loom and are held in tension, while the weft threads are woven horizontally over and under the warp threads. The way these threads are interlaced defines the fabric\'s strength, texture, flexibility, and appearance.</p>		\n									<h3>\n							Less breathable than natural fibers						\n					</h3>\n									<h3>\n							High durability and resistance to wear and tear						\n					</h3>\n									<h3>\n							Cost-effective to produce in large quantities						\n					</h3>\n									<h3>\n							Product Design &amp; Development						\n					</h3>\n									<h3>\n							Maecenas volutpat blandit aliquam etiam erat						\n					</h3>\n									<h3>\n							professional quality inspection teams						\n					</h3>\n									<h3>\n							Easy care and maintenance						\n					</h3>\n									<h3>\n							Derived from non-renewable fossil fuels						\n					</h3>\n					<h4>Quality Maintain Every Time</h4>				\n			<figure class=\'gallery-item\'>\n				<a data-elementor-open-lightbox=\"yes\" data-elementor-lightbox-slideshow=\"0725b62\" data-elementor-lightbox-title=\"service_7\" data-e-action-hash=\"#elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dlightbox%26settings%3DeyJpZCI6NDYyNiwidXJsIjoiaHR0cDpcL1wvc3Vuc3RleC50ZXN0XC93cC1jb250ZW50XC91cGxvYWRzXC8yMDI1XC8wOFwvc2VydmljZV83LmpwZyIsInNsaWRlc2hvdyI6IjA3MjViNjIifQ%3D%3D\" href=\'http://sunstex.test/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/service_7.jpg\'><img width=\"1000\" height=\"580\" src=\"http://sunstex.test/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/service_7.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"http://sunstex.test/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/service_7.jpg 1000w, http://sunstex.test/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/service_7-300x174.jpg 300w, http://sunstex.test/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/service_7-768x445.jpg 768w, http://sunstex.test/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/service_7-800x464.jpg 800w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1000px) 100vw, 1000px\" /></a>\n			</figure><figure class=\'gallery-item\'>\n				<a data-elementor-open-lightbox=\"yes\" data-elementor-lightbox-slideshow=\"0725b62\" data-elementor-lightbox-title=\"service_8\" data-e-action-hash=\"#elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dlightbox%26settings%3DeyJpZCI6NDYyNywidXJsIjoiaHR0cDpcL1wvc3Vuc3RleC50ZXN0XC93cC1jb250ZW50XC91cGxvYWRzXC8yMDI1XC8wOFwvc2VydmljZV84LmpwZyIsInNsaWRlc2hvdyI6IjA3MjViNjIifQ%3D%3D\" href=\'http://sunstex.test/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/service_8.jpg\'><img width=\"1000\" height=\"580\" src=\"http://sunstex.test/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/service_8.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"http://sunstex.test/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/service_8.jpg 1000w, http://sunstex.test/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/service_8-300x174.jpg 300w, http://sunstex.test/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/service_8-768x445.jpg 768w, http://sunstex.test/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/service_8-800x464.jpg 800w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1000px) 100vw, 1000px\" /></a>\n			</figure>\n		<p>In design, we bring characteristics of the natural world into built spaces, such as water, greenery, and natural light, or elements like wood and stone. Encouraging the use of natural systems and processes in design allows for exposure to nature, and in turn, these design approaches improve health and wellbeing. There are a number of possible benefits, including reduced heart rate variability and pulse rates, decreased blood pressure, and increased activity in our nervous systems, to name a few.</p>		\n					<h4>Understand your business</h4>				\n		<p>Lorem Ipsum is simply dummy text of the printing and typesetting industry. Lorem Ipsum has been the industry’s standard dummy text ever since the 1500s, when an unknown printer took a galley of type and scrambled it to make a type specimen book.</p>		\n						<details id=\"e-n-accordion-item-2270\" open>\n				<summary data-accordion-index=\"1\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-expanded=\"true\" aria-controls=\"e-n-accordion-item-2270\" >\n					<h5> what is main problems faced textile industry ? </h5>\n						</summary>\n									<p>If you are looking to lose weight, maintain healthy weight or gain lean muscle mass, our Certified Sports Nutritionist will create a personalized nutrition plan to help you achieve your goals.</p>								\n					</details>\n						<details id=\"e-n-accordion